From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:25:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] platform: host dispatch, Win32 compat for views and
 threads

src/host runs a title's startup in one place for the template and titles.
win32_compat keeps both process-mask capture and thread finish, looks
handles up through the object table, and validates mapped views.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
